## 13. API Data Flow

The required data flow:

```
Database
   |
   v
SQLAlchemy Model
   |
   v
Service
   |
   v
Pydantic VO
   |
   v
ApiResponse[T]
   |
   v
FastAPI JSON Response
```

Never:

```
Database
   |
   v
dict
   |
   v
Router
   |
   v
JSON
```

---

## 14. Refactoring Rules

When modifying existing code:

1. Do not refactor the whole project at once.
2. Modify one module at a time.
3. Preserve existing JSON structure.
4. Add response_model before changing implementation.
5. Run type checking after every module.

Recommended order:

```
1. app/utils/response.py

2. app/schemas/vo

3. app/services

4. app/routers
```

