## 15. Code Review Checklist

Before commit, check:

Forbidden:
```
return dict
return JSONResponse          # 业务 Router；全局 handler 除外
return ORM Model from Router
model_dump() in Router
VO.model_dump() for API output
tuple[VO | None, str | None] as HTTP error channel
__dict__
dict(model)
ApiResponse[Any]             # 业务路由；框架 list_/fail 除外
Any / dict[str, Any] / list[Any] on business function signatures
money/unit_price/fee/physical as float (use Decimal; JSON string)
```

Required:
```
Every JSON endpoint:
    response_model=ApiResponse[T]

Downloads / Excel export:
    StreamingResponse / FileResponse (no ApiResponse)

Every Router (except login):
    current_user via Depends(get_current_user)  # 仅 me/touch/logout
    OR Depends(require_perm(Perm.XXX)) / require_any_perm / require_admin_user  # 业务路由

Every business Router:
    no bare get_current_user without Perm
    no permission string literals — use Perm.*
    no if error: HTTPException / no if not vo: 404 / no except-then-HTTPException for business failures

Every write Router → Service:
    pass current_user=current_user

Every Router:
    JSON → ApiResponse.xxx(); downloads → StreamingResponse / FileResponse

Every Service:
    returns VO / list[VO] / (list, total[, filters]) / PageResult
    raises NotFoundException / BusinessException for HTTP-facing failures (conflict: code=409)
    no implicit current_user / ContextVar

Every Repository:
    returns SQLAlchemy Model (aggregates: TypedDict / read-model, not anonymous dict)

Frontend (same codes):
    menu → canAccessPage / applySidebarPermissions
    button → can('op:…')
    details → docs/permission-design.md
```
